    "slug": "svelte-review-before-you-migrate",
    "title": "Svelte review: reactivity boundaries to learn before you migrate",
    "description": "Svelte repository review of compilation, state proxies and browser-only effects, with adoption checks and limits from a pinned source snapshot.",
    "date": "2026-11-20",
